# Canvas Host Swap — Issues

## CHS-01 — Pin infinite-canvas into the repo
**Status:** completed
Vendor a pinned commit under `infinite-canvas/`, record SHA/license, keep it out of the pnpm workspace.

## CHS-02 — Dev command to launch the new host
**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CHS-01
`make canvas-install` + `make dev-canvas`; `make dev` also starts the host.

## CHS-03 — Point the old canvas route at the new host
**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CHS-02
Studio canvas route embeds the host in-place (`?embed=1`). No new tab.

## CHS-04 — Knowledge node plugin
**Status:** pending
Not this cut. Vault-server stays external.

## CHS-05 — Remove old canvas module
**Status:** pending
Not this cut.
